            "id": "block-4",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Wind, salt and patience shaped the town more than any decree ever did. ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "bold": true,
                "text": "A replacement sentence was supplied by the fourth reviewer, with a note about winter dredging. ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "Nobody remembered who had painted the clock face blue, but everybody agreed it suited the square.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-5",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Entire paragraph inserted by Dana: berth fees will be reviewed in spring.",
